    "title": "People Often Lie About Having Read These 27 Books To Sound Smart, So I'm Curious Whether You've Actually Read Them Or If They Have A Permanent Residence In Your TBR Pile (And More Book Quizzes!) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "These are some of the most well-known books in the English language. It's totally understandable if you've lied and said you read them to other people, but this is a safe space to tell the truth. Take the quiz here . At least half of these books were probably assigned reading for you at some point, but did you actually read them? Take the quiz here . Lots of famous books have been adapted into hit movies or TV shows, and diehard fans always have an opinion on which version is better. Take the quiz here . We've already shown you the authors of these books in the first two quizzes, so it should be easy to name them now! No cheating. Take the quiz here . Sure, you may have been a voracious reader as a child, but how many of those childhood classics do you remember? Take the quiz here .",
